    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ALG2_U03_L07_Q07</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.A2.RR.5; MLA.A2.RR.6</p><p>What happens to f(x)=1/(x-2) as x gets close to 2?</p>]]></text>
